Troubleshooting
  "RPC not available"
    > Check internet and https://rpc-hoodi.morphl2.io status
  "Invalid signature" / "Signature does not match payer"
    > The payer field in X-Payment must match the wallet that signed
    > FACILITATOR_ADDRESS in agent/.env must match X402_FACILITATOR_ADDRESS in backend/.env
  "Nonce used"
    > Each nonce is single-use. Get a fresh one from GET /payment/nonce
  "Provider payment failed"
    > Agent wallet has not approved the facilitator (step 8)
    > Or agent wallet has insufficient MockUSDC balance
    > Use POST /faucet/mint or cast send <USDC> "mint()" ...
  "Cooldown active"
    > MockUSDC faucet allows 1 mint per hour per wallet
    > Check GET /faucet/status/:address for cooldown remaining
  "Expired"
    > Nonces from GET /payment/nonce expire in 5 minutes
  ABIs not found (import error on startup)
    > Run forge build in packages/contracts first (step 1)
  Ledger replay is slow on startup
    > Set FACILITATOR_DEPLOY_BLOCK in apps/backend/.env to the block
      number when X402Facilitator was deployed (from forge script output)
